      "why_runtime": "Contents/Info.plist declares CFBundleHelpBookFolder=logic.help and that folder is on no disk here: Apple serves Logic's help over the network, at support.apple.com/guide/logicpro/<anchor>/mac. The only local trace is a Spotlight index under ~/Library/Caches/com.apple.helpd which carries page text and no anchor identifiers. So an Anchor-to-screen mapping exists and is not a local canonical fact."
